</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7edf4a12-9b2a-11f1-aa33-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26098769730041.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7edf4a12-9b2a-11f1-aa33-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26098769730041.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ee66fde2-9b27-11f1-909b-61c953ffb9fc</guid><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 17:33:35 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7edf4a12-9b2a-11f1-aa33-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26098769730041.jpg">AP - Rich Pedroncelli</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>诺基亚撤离中国：年底前裁减大部分员工 分阶段关闭各地工厂</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260818-%E8%AF%BA%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%9A%E6%92%A4%E7%A6%BB%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD-%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%95%E5%89%8D%E8%A3%81%E5%87%8F%E5%A4%A7%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%91%98%E5%B7%A5-%E5%88%86%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%E5%90%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82</link><description>
